## Architecture: How Bitrise MCP Bridges AI Agents to CI/CD

The Model Context Protocol (MCP) defines an open standard for LLMs to securely discover and invoke external tools. The enterprise hosts **`bitrise-mcp-server`** inside the **TrueFoundry MCP Gateway**, handling authentication, user identity verification, and proxying calls to Bitrise REST APIs:

